1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,767
To'xtang! Shu izohga javob yozishdan oldin buni ko'ring.

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:12,386
G'azab kelganda jim turish — kuchsizlik emas, kuch.

3
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:19,110
Hasadga tabassum bilan javob bering.

4
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,299
Qo'zg'atuvchiga javob bermaslik — aql.

5
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:34,321
Befoyda bahsdan o'z vaqtida chiqing.

6
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:42,437
Bosim ostida xotirjam bo'ling.

7
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:49,605
Kechira olgan odam — g'olib.

8
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:57,812
Bugun bitta odamni kechiring.

9
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:08,296
Jahlingizni chiqargan xabarni @sahiychishopbot'ga yuboring: xotirjam va hurmatli javob yozishga yordam beradi.

10
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:13,820
Siz-chi? Oxirgi marta qachon jim turib, yutdingiz? Izohga yozing!

